    "rotationData": {
        "champion_id": "apocalypse",
        "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gGfHD0Gp0to",
        "source_channel": "Marvel Contest of Champions",
        "summary_parts": [
            "Build to near 2 bars of power, do a medium-ending combo, then parry and heavy-cancel after the first hit into an SP2 to inflict Degen. Keep using heavies to refresh the degen, and when near a bar of power, do a medium-ending combo, parry, and heavy-cancel into SP1 to add <span class=\"tooltip\">Poison<span class=\"tooltiptext\"><img src=\"https://cocpit-cdn.nyc3.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/2026.09.09/glyphs/z-122.svg\" class=\"tooltip-icon\"><span class=\"tooltip-title\">Poison</span><br>While active, deals Direct Damage and reduces Regeneration Rate by 30% of its current value.</span></span>.",
            "For longer fights, build all four debuff types by throwing SP1 and SP2 twice each, once preceded by a light attack, and once preceded by a medium. Maintain the debuff uptime with heavies until reaching 3 bars of power, then throw SP3 to retrigger them at higher potency and lock them in indefinitely."
        ]
    },
